# basePath SupplyIntroCh3

:: StartBuilding
@trigger    OnSupplySetupCompleted
@when   !MinigameHasValidSolution()
$call   PointElement(supply:ship1)
{@PAL}  We have a new faster ship.\n\nYou can use it on longer routes to reduce travel time.

:: ShipSelected
@trigger    OnShipSelected
@when   !MinigameHasValidSolution()
$call   ReleaseAllHighlights()
$call   PointElement(supply:planet_p)
$call   PointElement(supply:planet_p_alt)
{@PAL}  There are two sources of phosphorus. Hover over the planets and compare the cost and time.


:: PlanetHovered
@trigger    OnPlanetHovered
@when   !MinigameHasValidSolution()
$call   ReleaseAllHighlights()


:: RouteCompleted
@trigger    OnRouteCompleted
@when   !MinigameHasValidSolution()
$call   ReleaseAllHighlights()
$call   CloseWiki()
$call   PointElement(supply:time-meter)
{@PAL}  All your ships travel at the same time. The one that takes the longest determines your total time.\n\nThis is called a bottleneck.
